@api = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Kiem tra may chu -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach sach -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/books

### 3. Chi tiet sach 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/books/1

### 4. Sach khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError (BOOK_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/books/999

### 5. Id khong phai so -> 404 Not Found rong (Framework)
GET {{api}}/api/books/abc

### 6. Them sach hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createBook
POST {{api}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "author": "Andrew Hunt",
  "publishYear": 1999
}

### 7. Doc lai sach vua tao theo Location/id -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Du lieu khong hop le -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError (INVALID_BOOK)
POST {{api}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "publishYear": -1
}

### 9. Them trung tieu de sach -> 409 Conflict + ApiError (DUPLICATE_BOOK)
POST {{api}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publishYear": 2008
}

### 10. Phuong thuc khong ho tro -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publishYear": 2008
}

### 11. Thieu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/books

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "author": "Martin Fowler",
  "publishYear": 2018
}

